<title>JAPAN: Seibu Electric &amp; Mac - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Seibu Electric &amp; Mac - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.07		vs	    8.27</p>
<p> Operating   loss 111    million	  vs    loss 13    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 107    million	  vs    loss 30    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 112    million	  vs    loss 28    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 7.41 yen	  vs     loss 1.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Seibu Electric &amp; Machinery Co Ltd makes machine tools, conveyors, industrial machinery and electrodischarge machines.</p>
</text>
